sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Remote (table 3)
    participant X as Receiver
    Note over R: button press, debounce, seq=17, epoch=5
    R->>X: CALL (5,17)
    X--xR: radio ACK lost
    Note over R: no radio ACK, backoff 60..180 ms
    R->>X: CALL (5,17) same seq
    X-->>R: radio auto-ACK
    Note over X: first copy was also received earlier: DUPLICATE
    X->>R: CALL_ACCEPTED (duplicate, no new entry)
    Note over R: matching (table,epoch,seq): accepted, LED 1 s solid
    loop every 8 s up to 300 s
        R->>X: STATUS_REQ (5,17)
        X->>R: CALL_ACCEPTED (still pending)
    end
    Note over X: staff press ACK, oldest call marked served
    X->>R: CALL_SERVED (best effort)
    R->>X: STATUS_REQ (5,17)
    X->>R: CALL_SERVED
    Note over R: LED 3 slow blinks, polling stops
    Note over X: receiver reboots: restore table from EEPROM
    R->>X: STATUS_REQ (call lost in the save window)
    X->>R: ERROR (unknown call)
    R->>X: CALL (5,17) re-sent, same seq
    X->>R: CALL_ACCEPTED (new)
